# Indigo Glass — Microsoft Edge user-local override
# Copy to ~/.local/share/applications/microsoft-edge.desktop
# Forces Wayland-native rendering + system decorations to integrate with Klassy
#
# Usage:
#   cp /usr/share/applications/microsoft-edge.desktop ~/.local/share/applications/
#   patch ~/.local/share/applications/microsoft-edge.desktop with these Exec= lines:

# Replace the bare Exec= line:
#   Exec=/usr/bin/microsoft-edge-stable %U
# with:
#   Exec=/usr/bin/microsoft-edge-stable --ozone-platform=wayland --enable-features=UseOzonePlatform,WaylandWindowDecorations --enable-wayland-ime --gtk-version=4 --disable-features=WaylandFractionalScaleV1 --use-system-default-print %U
